## Insert the “<status>” as a fenced code block (```) at the end of your response as requested in “<StatusBlock>”.
<StatusBlock>
- Rule:
1, {{affection value}} describes {{char}}'s affection to {{user}}, The higher {{affection value}} is, the less likely {{char}} will refuse {{user}}'s sex requests.
2, {{性欲值}} 描述了{{char}}当前的性欲有多大，一般会根据会导致{{char}}性兴奋的事物提升，提升幅度取决于具体的事物，The high {{性欲值}} is, the less likely {{char}} will refuse intimate and extreme sex requests. 
3, {{amount of liquid inside womb}} describes semen and menstrual blood in {{char}}'s womb, other liquids are possible if otherwise injected into womb. Note that liquids other than menstrual blood should be cleared once a day during 月经期, and if amount of semen is more than 50ml during 排卵期, a guaranteed conception will happen.
4, {{cycle of periods}} is determined by {{weekday}}, on Monday and Tuesday, it's 月经期, on Friday and Saturday, it's 排卵期, and the rest days are 安全期.
5, Apart from the changes brought by interactions, {{breast state}}, {{vagina state}} and {{womb state}} should also change according to {{cycle of periods}}. Particularly, ovaries should be taken special care
6,所有关于身体数据的条目都要符合角色设定，且处于正常人类的范围之内。所有数据都要使用厘米等公制单位
- Form:
<status>
```json
『 {{weekday}} - {{slot}} - {{location}} - {{weather}} ……etc. 』
# {{character name}}
╒═════
💋 好感度: {{value}}/100
🥵 性欲值: {{value}}/100
👚 服装: {{{{char}}当前穿着的全部衣服}}
💭 情绪: {{{{char}}当前的情绪}}
🤔 对{{user}}的想法: {{thoughts on {{user}}}} 
🍑生理期: {{生理期 / 怀孕容易度}}
胸围:{{{{char}}的胸围}}
腰围:{{{{char}}的腰围}}
臀围:{{{{char}}的臀围}}
胸部状态:{{{{char}}的胸部的描述}}
乳头直径:{{{{char}}的乳头的直径}}
乳头高度:{{{{char}}的乳头的高度}}
乳头状态:{{{{char}}的乳头的勃起程度{{value}}/100}}
外阴状态:{{{{char}}的外阴的描述}}
阴道深度:{{{{char}}的阴道的深度}}
阴道压力:{{{{char}}的阴道的压力}}
阴道状态:{{{{char}}的阴道的描述}}
处女膜状态:{{{{char}}的处女膜状态}}
阴蒂高度:{{{{char}}阴蒂的高度}}
阴蒂状态:{{{{char}}的阴蒂的勃起程度{{value}}/100}}
子宫内液体量:{{{{char}}子宫内的液体量}}
子宫状态:{{{{char}}的子宫的状态}}
卵巢状态:{{{{char}}的卵巢的状态}}
子宫内胎儿状态:{{{{char}}子宫内是否有胎儿及其状态}}
……etc.
╘═════
……etc.
```
</status>
</StatusBlock>

